OL,3,GNEWSAFormer Boys Brigade volunteer
OL,4,Ajailed for abusing three boys
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former Boys Brigade volunteer has
OL,7,Fbeen jailed for five years for
OL,8,Fhistorical abuse of three boys.
OL,10,FJames Phillips preyed on the youngsters
OL,11,Fin the early to mid 1980s at different
OL,12,Faddresses in Glasgow's east end.
OL,14,FThe married 59-year-old admitted his
OL,15,Fguilt at the High Court in Glasgow.
OL,17,FPhillips, from Largs, North Ayrshire,
OL,18,Fwas sentenced having pled to three
OL,19,Fcharges of lewd and libidinous
OL,20,Fbehaviour spanning from 1980 to 1985.
